In simple terms, an EIP (Ethereum Improvement Proposal) is the official process for suggesting any change to Ethereum, including the core software and rules. 

An ERC (Ethereum Request for Comments) is a specific type of EIP that focuses on creating a standard for things built on top of Ethereum, like tokens and decentralized applications (dApps), to ensure they can all work together.




